    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d950">

                <pb facs="0918" n="820" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg820"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Nicaraguan Minister of Foreign
                            Affairs to Secretary of Chilean Legation,
                            Washington.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg of you to communicate to the Secretary of State that the Government has
                    ordered the return of the duties to the American merchants.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Corea.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
